an style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-string-expression)\"> \"!\"</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">  // 先收窄，+ 才确定是数值加法还是字符串拼接</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">}</span></span></code></pre>",
